OL,3,GNEWSA'Having a stroke at 26 was massive
OL,4,Alearning curve'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt 26, Niamh Foster never imagined that
OL,7,Fshe would have a stroke.
OL,9,FWith no family history of the disease,
OL,10,Fthe keen runner and former competitive
OL,11,Fswimmer attributed a month of headaches
OL,12,Fand fatigue to the stress of moving
OL,13,Fhome and preparing for her busy period
OL,14,Fat work, London Fashion Week.
OL,16,FBut on 28 August 2024, after a night of
OL,17,Fdisturbed sleep, she looked at her
OL,18,Freflection in the bathroom mirror and
OL,19,Fsaw that half of her face had drooped
OL,20,Fdownwards.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
